  "maintenanceChanges": [
    "Nickname safety now sends exact known species names with obvious UI affixes such as leading V= or trailing bare LV/SP to review without rewriting the nickname.",
    "Locked food3 adds a review-only safety guard for the reproduced low-confidence Mushroom-over-Soy confusion; it never auto-relabels the food.",
    "Diagnostic JSON now preserves the immutable nickname review state captured at analysis completion and separately records whether the nickname was manually confirmed later.",
    "Candidate100 classifier/master/food matcher algorithms, CSV contract, PWA UI, checkpoint compatibility ID, and unrelated recognition behavior remain unchanged.",
    "Invalidate current nickname manual confirmation on actual text edits and reopen; preserve analysis snapshot.",
    "Review-only guards for reproduced locked food3 low-confidence mushroom/milk and coffee/honey patterns.",
    "Remove RP collection project from the visible source list as previously requested by the user; historical provenance records are retained."
  ],
